{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "GET Queue-list",
    "version": "1.0",
    "description": "\n  # Introduction\n\n**Get queue-list** is a REST/JSON API. It will help to get the list of PNR and related information based on the given queue number .\nYou can also provide an optional fields like category(default value is 0),queuing office id and count to get the max number of response .\nIn the result it will display the list of PNR with related information based on the PNR creation date.\n\n\n# Authorization\n\nBefore using the API you will need to get an access token. Please read our **[Authorization Guide](https://developers.amadeus.com/self-service/apis-docs/guides/authorization)** for more information on how to get your token.\n\n# Suported Operations:\n   supported operation by ressource:\n  - GET: To get the list of PNR and related information."
  },
  "servers": [{
    "url": "https://test.travel.api.amadeus.com/v1"
  }],
